      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5de9405aea7cc52772fcc359|full_name}: Sorting by last modified is a really nice QOL feature and I do love this change, but feel an active projects category or symbol is still needed. Maybe something like that green dot we already have when you have a project selected, but instead visible in the project view so you can see all active projects at a glance.\nIt would be helpful in cases where you've got multiple projects open, IE backups, main project, other side things, ect that you probably would want a mental note of before you do changes that were meant for somewhere else. I've had times where I'd do changes to a Quest project that was laid out identically to my PC one in the past and end up having to redo all Quest specific logic of mine because I didn't realize both were open.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
